Depends: bash (>= 4.4), libglib2.0-bin
Recommends: libnotify-bin
Description: Modular CLI wallpaper switcher and daemon for GNOME
 Command-line utility and background systemd service for GNOME desktop
 wallpaper management and automated transitions with category filtering,
 history undo, keymap triggers, and seamless light/dark theme synchronization.
